# Build-context trimming for the slim explorer image.
#
# Goal: ship the runtime tree (the explorer app + the analyses/archive files
# the compute and findings paths read) while excluding the ~7 GB of local-dev
# and research bulk. The Phase 2 `docker run` + smoke test is the safety net:
# if an over-broad exclude drops a runtime file, /api/compute or
# /api/concepts/{id}/findings 500s locally — before any cloud spend.
#
# MUST survive (verified present): exploration/concept_explorer/{data,static,
# templates}, exploration/concept_analysis/analyses/*/{model_setup.py,
# analysis.md}, exploration/concept_analysis/scripts/lib/,
# exploration/concept_analysis/tables/archetype_fit.csv,
# archive/concept_analysis_pre_rework/*/analysis.md.

# Version control + local virtualenv (.venv alone is ~6.1 GB).
.git
.venv
serve-venv

# Research bulk — no serving-runtime code references knowledge/ (grep-verified).
knowledge

# Archive: keep ONLY the findings fallback subtree (concept_analysis_pre_rework,
# read at server.py:774); drop everything else under archive/.
archive/*
!archive/concept_analysis_pre_rework

# These come LAST so they override the archive re-include above (in a
# .dockerignore the last matching pattern wins). They re-exclude intermediate
# analyzer artifacts and caches wherever they live, including inside the
# otherwise-kept analyses/ and archive/ trees.
**/iter-*/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
*.log
.DS_Store
